  "translation": "Na andũ ake macio othe nĩma cedeki, hĩndĩ ciothe nĩmakoragĩra ⟨kĩndũ gĩa kũhanda⟩ nthĩ; nĩmagĩrĩirio kuuma mũmera wa kũhanda kwakwa, ũndũ wa mikono yakwa, ndũrũrĩ-inĩ ⟨ya⟩ kĩenorwo.",
